  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">此模組新增了大部分 TFC 的主要地質礦床，可使用 Create 模組的「鑽機」進行開採。<br>配方與工具已進行調整，以對應 Terrafirmacraft 世界的物品。<br>若要開採金屬礦石，需先使用地質探測儀尋找礦脈位置，<br>接著在該處建造鑽機，並為鑽頭提供適當冷卻，同時為機器供應水源。<br><br>新增與 Firmalife、TFC IE Addon、Mekanism 等模組的相容性&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&gt;基礎礦石與岩石礦脈&lt;<br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 錫鉛銅礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 金銅礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 錫石&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 黃銅礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 朱砂&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 銅藍&nbsp;&nbsp;* 稀有寶石&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 赤鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 紅土&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 磁鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 鎂鉍礦&nbsp;* 孔雀石&nbsp;&nbsp;* 鎳黃鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;* 錫黃銅礦</span><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/796/464/multi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"737\" height=\"402\">=======================================================================================<br>&nbsp;* 鉻鐵礦 - 相容於 Firmalife<br>&nbsp;* 鋁土礦&nbsp; - 相容於 TFC IE Addon<br>&nbsp;* 方鉛礦&nbsp; &nbsp;- 相容於 TFC IE Addon<br>&nbsp;* 鈾礦 - 相容於 TFC IE Addon<br>&nbsp;* 锇礦&nbsp; - 相容於 Mekanism<br>======================================================================================<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/796/465/multi-compat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"539\"><br>&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><br>defaultconfigs 1.20.1<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><br><strong>importantInfo = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>finiteAmountBase = 1000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>defaultInfinite = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>maxExtractorsPerVein = 20</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderNear = 8</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderFar = 10</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderCd = 10</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong><br>defaultconfigs 1.18.2<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><strong>importantInfo = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>generationChance = 5000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>finiteAmountBase = 1000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>defaultInfinite = false</strong></div>\n<br>\n<div><strong>maxExtractorsPerVein = 0</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">1.18.2<br><span><iframe style=\"width:801px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MWm0LC9laF8\" width=\"801\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span><br><br></span></strong></span></p>",
